************************************************************************        
*                                                                      *        
* JOBSTEG 3  MATCHAR TEMP2 MOT CDC-LAGERBANDET                         *        
*                                                                      *        
************************************************************************        
JOB INPUT (WXTR9ND1  KEY (   CDC-IDARTNR)                  +                    
           WXTR9ND7  KEY (    T2-IDARTNR))                 +                    
NAME STEG3-MATCHAR-O-SKRIVER                                                    
                                                                                
  IF MATCHED WXTR9ND1 WXTR9ND7                                                  
    PERFORM A-SKRIV-ART-UPPGIFTER                                               
    PERFORM B-SKRIV-NDC-UPPGIFTER                                               
    PERFORM S23-CHECK-T2-IDDC                                                   
    IF T2-IDDC = NDC-CN                                                         
       PERFORM C-SKRIV-CN-UPPGIFTER                                             
       PUT WXTR9ND9                                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
    PUT WXTR9ND6                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF WXTR9ND7                                                                 
      DISPLAY 'ARTIKELN ' T2-IDARTNR ' SAKNAS PÅ CDC-FILEN'                     
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
A-SKRIV-ART-UPPGIFTER. PROC                                                     
  NDC-IDARTNR       = CDC-IDARTNR                                               
  NDC-REKSIFFR      = CDC-REKSIFFR                                              
